  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine tamarind seasoning, the garlic, honey, soy sauce and vinegar.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf31f/step-07dfc400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add honey-soy glaze and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf31f/step-e2f83610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine slaw mix, the mayonnaise and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf31f/step-ba1d6220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build tacos by filling with some creamy slaw and tamarind tofu.\n• Spoon over any remaining glaze from the pan. Garnish with spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf31f/step-b31b5330.jpg"
    }
  ]
